# Session ordering editor

Create a current session and two other live sessions. The compact header shows
only enabled comparator initials, bold, in priority order. Up arrows put live
and recent values first; down arrows put names in A–Z order. Hide the preview
before each snapshot so the complete session order is visible.

    :b jj tmux cat (available)
    :t rename-session -t 0 runner (success)
    :t new-session -d -s alpha cat (success)
    :t new-session -d -s beta cat (success)
    :t resize-window -t runner:0 -x 100 -y 18 (success)
    :t respawn-pane -k -t runner:0 'smth; cat' (success)
    :p runner:0.0
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k C-p
    :snap --color

```terminal
session:                                                                                           ┃
  3/3 | [M-s] ↑l ↑r ↓n | [C-r] repo: none                                                          ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                          ┃
▌■ alpha                                                                                           ┃
 ■ beta                                                                                            ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                           ┃
```

![light](session-ordering.md.snap.1.light.svg)
![dark](session-ordering.md.snap.1.dark.svg)

An explicitly empty stack shows just `order`, and selects the first discovery
result rather than preferring recency.

    :t respawn-pane -k -t runner:0 'smth --order ""; cat' (success)
    :settle -d 2s (settled)
    :k C-p
    :snap --color

```terminal
session:                                                                                           ┃
  3/3 | [M-s] order | [C-r] repo: none                                                             ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
▌■ alpha                                                                                           ┃
 ■ beta                                                                                            ┃
 ■ runner                                                                                          ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
                                                                                                   ┃
 [C-x] close, [C-f] flag                                                                           ┃
```

![light](session-ordering.md.snap.2.light.svg)
![dark](session-ordering.md.snap.2.dark.svg)

